[38;5;10mLZ4F_optimalBSID[0m ([38;5;10mc_src/src/lz4frame.c:364[0m) compares [38;5;10mrequestedBSID > proposedBSID[0m. [38;5;10mLZ4F_blockSizeID_t[0m declares only non-negative enumerators, so GCC gives it an [1munsigned[22m underlying type — that comparison is unsigned. A negative [38;5;10mblockSizeID[0m arriving across the FFI boundary compares as a huge value, enters the loop, and gets clamped to [38;5;10mLZ4F_max64KB[0m.[0m[0m
